Description: Sandbox permissions for every palOS app
 Ubuntu 24.04 only lets an app start its own sandbox when an AppArmor profile
 says it may. Apps without one fell back to an older sandbox and could fail to
 start (Mail, Calendar and Time Turner from the Dock). This gives every palOS
 app built on Electron its profile.
